{"id":"fabb5bd6ddfe85a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Inverse Limit Carrier","display":"df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier — ZFC Topo11 Inverse Limit Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier — ZFC Topo11 Inverse Limit Carrier","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier — ZFC Topo11 Inverse Limit Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" href=\"?note=3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f6ab9827c296452\" href=\"?note=9f6ab9827c296452\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,I,X,f,\\leq_I\\in V\">\\(L,I,X,f,\\leq_I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\">\\(\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S\\)</span> is the directed-preorder predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f6ab9827c296452\" href=\"?note=9f6ab9827c296452\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and function application are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S\\)</span> is the product-family predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" href=\"?note=3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,j\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\)</span> is the ordered-pair code (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,X,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,J,B,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land J=\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I\\times I:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,J,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\n\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f(\\langle i,j\\rangle),X(j),X(i))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in X(i)\\;\nf(\\langle i,i\\rangle)(x)=x\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\to\\forall x\\in X(k)\\;\nf(\\langle i,k\\rangle)(x)=f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(f(\\langle j,k\\rangle)(x))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S(P,I,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land L=\\{x\\in P:\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(x(j))=x(i))\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,X,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,J,B,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land J=\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I\\times I:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,J,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\n\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f(\\langle i,j\\rangle),X(j),X(i))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in X(i)\\;\nf(\\langle i,i\\rangle)(x)=x\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\to\\forall x\\in X(k)\\;\nf(\\langle i,k\\rangle)(x)=f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(f(\\langle j,k\\rangle)(x))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S(P,I,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land L=\\{x\\in P:\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(x(j))=x(i))\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The directed relation is now an explicit predicate argument; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and the bonding maps are typed functions, and identity/composition coherence is part of the inverse-system data.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dc4b831bf6ebd98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f6ab9827c296452","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f6ab9827c296452","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S$ is the directed-preorder predicate (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and function application are as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dc4b831bf6ebd98","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S$ is the product-family predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle i,j\\rangle$ is the ordered-pair code (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,I,X,f,\\leq_I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle i,j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S(L,I,\\leq_I,X,f)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,J,B,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,U)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land J=\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I\\times I:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,J,B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\n\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f(\\langle i,j\\rangle),X(j),X(i))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall x\\in X(i)\\;\nf(\\langle i,i\\rangle)(x)=x\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\\\\n&\\hspace{31mm}\\to\\forall x\\in X(k)\\;\nf(\\langle i,k\\rangle)(x)=f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(f(\\langle j,k\\rangle)(x))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S(P,I,X)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land L=\\{x\\in P:\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\to f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)(x(j))=x(i))\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":2375,"backlinks":[{"id":"df815e8df491d6c1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11InverseLimitCarrier}_S$ is the canonical inverse-limit carrier predicate (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3683","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier.md|58-df-zfc-topo11-inverse-limit-carrier]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3dc4b831bf6ebd98","36d7463d215be751","9f6ab9827c296452","599d16bb1d9ed41c"]}